OL,3,GNEWSADid loud music cause city centre
OL,4,Abridge to collapse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footbridge in the centre of Bristol
OL,7,Fmay have further collapsed into water
OL,8,Fbecause of vibrations from loud music,
OL,9,Fthe chair of the Harbour Committee has
OL,10,Fclaimed.
OL,12,FPero's Bridge, which could lift to
OL,13,Fallow boats under it, had already been
OL,14,Fleft partially hanging due to a
OL,15,Fmechanical failure in the summer. But
OL,16,Fit toppled again into the harbour below
OL,17,Fon Halloween evening.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
