OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSADid loud music cause city centre
OL,4,Abridge to collapse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat councillor Andrew
OL,7,FBrown said engineers believe the
OL,8,Fcollapse may gave been caused by
OL,9,F"external vibrations disturbing the
OL,10,Fbalance of the structure".
OL,12,F"These could have resulted from gusts
OL,13,Fof wind, nearby heavy road traffic or
OL,14,Floud music being played through
OL,15,Fspeakers on the shore," he said.
